 which a computer, an attached device, a data file, or a program can work with or understand the same commands, formats, or language as another. True compatibility means that any operational differences are invisible to people and programs alike.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36322">compatibility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497474">compatibilidade</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10190_122191_498036"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A command button used in a toolbar (or status bar).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="122191">toolbar button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="498036">botón da barra de ferramentas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10198_1250377_1275826"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Microsoft Dynamics CRM that provides a process for drafting, submitting, reviewing, and publishing knowledge base articles.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250377">Knowledge Base</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275826">Xestor de Knowledge Base</term><termNote