n a workflow that is entered when specified conditions are met.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1166123">workflow stage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1660630">fase do fluxo de traballo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25_42999_1178138"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In communications, the portion of a Data Terminal Equipment (DTE) device that sends data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="42999">data source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1178138">orixe de datos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2500_81423_1950342"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual who reviews content in certain online newsgroups, mailing lists, and forums in order to decide if they are appropriate or not, editing or deleting the ones that aren’t prior to them being they are made public.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81423">moderator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1950342">moderador</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNot