OfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27565_1382243_1520380"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A folder someone using Windows Live Sync is synchronizing between computers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1382243">synced folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520380">cartafol sincronizado</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27578_1385957_1413392"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to navigate directly to the webpage of the top-ranked search result when a search is performed in the address bar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1385957">Address Bar Top Result</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1413392">Resultado principal de la barra de enderezos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27584_1387192_1744226"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The return to a customer's account of funds that were used to purchase an item. This may occur as a result of a customer's contacting a bank to dispute a credit-card transaction.</descrip></desc