pe="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610721">haa</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28254_1475553_2588467"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique identifying number assigned to a shipment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1475553">tracking number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2588467">número de seguimento</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28260_1475757_1973276"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of users of Office 365 who have their sign-in priveleges blocked. It is also the name of a view in the users and groups section of Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1475757">sign-in blocked users</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1973276">usuarios con inicio de sesión bloqueado</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28261_1475758_1973277"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of users of Office 365 who have their sign-in privileges allowed. It is also the name of a view in the users and groups section of Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1475758">sign-in allowed users</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1973277">usuarios con inicio de sesión permitido</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28263_1475805_1520387"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A computer that a customer adds to their Windows Live account security information from which they can reset a forgotten password without providing further information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1475805">trusted PC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520387">computador de confianza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28286_1479033_1606586"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The public multinational corporation that develops, manufactures, licenses, and supports a wide range of products and services predominantly related to computing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1479033">Microsoft</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xm