verse alphabetical order, numerical values are arranged from largest to smallest, and dates and times are arranged from newest to oldest.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506687">descending order</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3146615">De Z a A</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29132_3145165_3146615"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sort order in which text strings are arranged in reverse alphabetical order, numerical values are arranged from largest to smallest, and dates and times are arranged from newest to oldest.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3145165">Z to A</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3146615">De Z a A</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29133_1506689_1787132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of grouping that removes documents with duplicate or near-duplicate content from search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506689">duplicate result removal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1787132">eliminación de duplicados</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><