 can be called from clients such as desktop PCs and mobile devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641032">client object model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656562">modelo de obxectos cliente</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32221_1641032_1656578"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of APIs for SharePoint products. These APIs are based on the server object model, and can be called from clients such as desktop PCs and mobile devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641032">client object model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656578">CSOM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32221_1641033_1656562"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of APIs for SharePoint products. These APIs are based on the server object model, and can be called from clients such as desktop PCs and mobile devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1641033">CSOM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656562">modelo de obxectos cliente</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="pa