 type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1771868">peso</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33960_1961342_1972939"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To load content in the background before a user sees it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961342">preload</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1972939">precargar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33961_1961343_1973596"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Check box that indicates if the user wants to create a campaign response based on the information that is included in the opportunity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961343">Record a closed campaign response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1973596">Rexistrar unha resposta de campaña pechada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33962_1961344_1973587"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descri