pe="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300323">Optimización de entrega</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39475_2295325_2300327"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service for downloading Windows updates and Windows Store apps from sources in addition to Microsoft and sending them to other PCs in a local network or on the Internet reducing the amount of Internet bandwidth needed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2295325">Windows Update Delivery Optimization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300327">Optimización de entrega de Windows Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39475_2298835_2300323"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service for downloading Windows updates and Windows Store apps from sources in addition to Microsoft and sending them to other PCs in a local network or on the Internet reducing the amount of Internet bandwidth needed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298835">Delivery Optimization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300323">Optimización de entrega</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39475_2298835_2300327"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service for downloading Windows updates and Windows Store apps from sources in addition to Microsoft and sending them to other PCs in a local network or on the Internet reducing the amount of Internet bandwidth needed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298835">Delivery Optimization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300327">Optimización de entrega de Windows Update</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39476_2296026_2300797"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Microsoft Rights Management Services to documents and share them both internally as well as with other businesses, limit who gets access to such documents, set an expiration date and monitor who has accessed, opened, used, and changed them or attempted to view them, when and from where, and possibly revoke access when necessary regardless of where they are stored.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2296026">Document Tracking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300797">Rastrexamento de documentos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpee