luding time by categories like meetings, email, focus hours, and after hours work as well as network insights such as top collaborators and contacts with whom users may be losing touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429250">Microsoft MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2431879">Microsoft MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40311_2429250_2589926"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft service that shows users how they spend their work time, including time by categories like meetings, email, focus hours, and after hours work as well as network insights such as top collaborators and contacts with whom users may be losing touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429250">Microsoft MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2589926">MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40311_2588076_2431879"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft service that shows users how they spend their work time, including time by categories like meetings, email, focus hours, and after hours work as well as network insights such as top collaborators and contacts with whom users may be losing touch.