ped by entity types, such as accounts, contacts, or leads. It allows the user to search on key words across all records types.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2418367">categorized search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429263">Procura rápida</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41891_2370613_2429259"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The geographic coordinates (latitude and longitude) obtained from converting a postal address, which can be used to find a position on a map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370613">geocode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429259">xeocodificación</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41892_2370614_2429260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process to correct discrepancies that may arise between the value of inventory captured in records and the value of the actual on-hand inventory count. Inventory adjustments are used to correct these differences to avoid overstating or understating the income statement.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2370614">inventory adjustment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</term