oun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2387508">Linguaxe inclusiva</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42136_2386268_2387510"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Editor feature that detects punctuation errors and then offers suggestions to help users to adhere to punctuation standards.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2386268">Punctuation Conventions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2387510">Convencións de puntuación</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42137_2386269_2387512"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Editor feature that detects potential issues with a user’s vocabulary choice and offers suggestions that help the user choose the right word in the appropriate context.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2386269">Vocabulary Choice</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2387512">Elección de vocabulario</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote>