/termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42317_2394292_2415750"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formal approach used by organizations to orchestrate, prioritize and benefit from projects by examining the risk-reward of each project, the available funds, the likelihood of a project's duration, and the expected outcomes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2394292">PPM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415750">xestión de cartafoles de proxectos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42319_2394286_2415752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email that is triggered after a transaction, such as order confirmation, password reset, delivery notification, new account signup, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2394286">transactional email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2415752">correo electrónico transaccional</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42326_2394553_2396404"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">After a build update, to load an app with domain data (such as data from a database, from the network, or from a file system), during the download process. Before this step, the app canno