 eDiscovery mode that tags issues and that can be set for individual users and issues for user authorizations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2446339">Sampling mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453863">modo Mostraxe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43194_2446340_2450635"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that is pre-marked prior to being loaded into Advanced eDiscovery in order to accelerate the Relevance training process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2446340">seed file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2450635">ficheiro de inicio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43195_2446341_2450638"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user-set measurement of the minimal level of similarity required for two files to be considered as near-duplicates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2446341">similarity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2450638">semellanza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termN