The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493748">Stretch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499451">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493752_2499450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493752">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499450">Stretch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44354_2493752_2499451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows you to migrate your cold data transparently and securely to the Microsoft Azure cloud, freeing up space, reducing cost and maintenance, without impacting your existing operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2493752">Stretch Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Pro