ype="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128874">Control de aplicacións para empresas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128314_3128873"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128314">App Control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128873">Control de aplicacións</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128314_3128874"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128314">App Control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128874">Control de aplicacións para empresas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech"