ular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47155_2655358_2673536"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that features a single, primary measure, compares that measure to one or more other measures to enrich its meaning, and displays it in the context of qualitative ranges of performance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2655358">bullet chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673536">gráfica con viñetas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47155_2655409_2673536"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that features a single, primary measure, compares that measure to one or more other measures to enrich its meaning, and displays it in the context of qualitative ranges of performance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2655409">bullet graph</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673536">gráfica con viñetas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47156_2655413_2670756"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The visual designed to create bullet charts. It includes four orientations and some customization options.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2655413">Bullet Chart</term><termNote typ