 service to secure an access token from Azure Active Directory on behalf of the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2713976">On-Behalf-Of flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726136">fluxo On-Behalf-Of</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48091_2713977_2726135"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An OAuth 2.0 flow used to propagate the delegated user identity and permission through the request chain, by allowing the middle-tier service to secure an access token from Azure Active Directory on behalf of the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2713977">OBO flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726135">fluxo OBO</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48091_2713977_2726136"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An OAuth 2.0 flow used to propagate the delegated user identity and permission through the request chain, by allowing the middle-tier service to secure an access token from Azure Active Directory on behalf of the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2713977">OBO flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726136">fluxo On-Behalf-Of</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4810_169828_1555497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A physical card that represents a specific value or amount of service for which the user has paid in advance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169828">prepaid card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1555497">cartón de prepago</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4810_169828_2057913"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A physical card that represents a specific value or amount of service for which the user has paid in advance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169828">prepaid card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2057913">tarxeta de prepago</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48101_2714782_2724577"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure Storage service tier that delivers reliable, low-cost disk support for VMs running latency-insensitive workloads.</d