 enables user interaction or input, often to initiate an action, display information, or set values.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2086075">visual</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497497">control</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4835_39274_497497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that enables user interaction or input, often to initiate an action, display information, or set values.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39274">control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497497">control</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48369_2735236_2736338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A level of access that gives a user permission beyond what is typically necessary for day-to-day operations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2735236">privileged access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2736338">acceso privilexiado</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="gra