oun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49787_2816023_2816716"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An office organization system which involves multiple workers using a single physical work station or surface during different time periods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816023">hot desking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816716">uso compartido dun espazo de traballo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49787_2816024_2816715"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An office organization system which involves multiple workers using a single physical work station or surface during different time periods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816024">hot-desking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816715">uso compartido de espazos de traballo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49787_2816024_2816716"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An office organization system which involves multiple workers using a single physical work station or surface during different time periods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816024">hot-desking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816716">uso compartido dun espazo de traballo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49788_2816025_2816722"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that protects against harmful links (URLs) in incoming emails.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816025">URL threat protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816722">protección contra ameazas de URL</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49789_2816026_2816718"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Sample content used to train a classifier.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816026">seed content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816718">contido de mostra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49790_2816032_2840752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that performs static analysis on custom configurations and coded components of Power Apps, seeking to identify contraventions to documented patterns/practices established to reduce complexity and improve performance, security and reliability of solutions built on the Power Apps platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816032">Power Apps Checker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2840752">Verificador de Power Apps</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49794_2816264_2819383"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To factor a number means to break it up into numbers that can be multiplied together to get the original number. EXAMPLES: 6 = 3 x 2 so, factors of 6 are 3 and 2; 9 = 3 x 3 so, factors of 9 are 3 and 3.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816264">factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819383">factorizar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49795_2816502_2819468"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office 365 offering for large nonprofits that includes email, Office desktop applications, cloud file-storage and sharing, web conferencing with IM, audio, HD video, and meeting broadcasts over th