d visuals, symbols, including emojis, that users can select to indicate their reaction to a video, topic, or other input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817594">Reaction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2820698">Reacción</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49843_2817608_2820720"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A short message that an educator can add to a student's video to showcase the video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817608">Vibe</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2820720">Comentario destacado</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49844_2817623_2820252"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique identifier, part of the Flipgrid URL, that provides direct access to a Flipgrid resource (topic, video, etc.). For example: flipgrid.com/FLIPCODE</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817623">Flip Code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2820252">código Flip</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49846_2818592_2840754"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The location where administrators manage organization-level settings and integrations for Power Apps, Microsoft Power Automate, and Dynamics 365 apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818592">Power Platform admin center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2840754">Centro de administración de Power Platform</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49850_2819348_2822357"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint feature that allows users to configure a filter list to use metadata tree view hierarchies and set filter controls to improve navigation and filtering of the list items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819348">metadata navigation filtering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822357">filtrado e navegación de metadatos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49850_2819348_2822359"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint feature that allows users to configure a filter list to use metadata tree view hierarchies and set filter controls to improve navigation and filtering of the list items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819348">metadata navigation filtering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822359">filtrado de navegación de metadatos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49850_2819349_2822357"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint feature that allows users to configure a filter list to use metadata tree view hierarchies and set filter controls to improve navigation and filtering of the list items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819349">metadata navigation and filtering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2822357">filtrado e navegación de metadatos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49850_2819349_2822359"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint feature that allows users to configure a filter list to use metadata tree view hierarchies and set filter controls to improve navigation and filtering of the list items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2819349">metadata navigation and filtering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSe