r">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50899_2876395_2877535"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A characteristic that helps a machine-learned model recognize a particular concept that is a hint that the algorithm can use, but not a hard rule.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2876395">explanation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2877535">explicación</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5090_115534_497985"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A special control added to a window, typically adjacent to the scroll bar, that allows a user to split a window or adjust a window split.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115534">split box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497985">caixa de división</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50900_2876396_2877708"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service that manages the classification and hierarchical relationships between items such as words, labels, or tags in a system, which includes user-generated and system-generated classifications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2876396">taxonomy service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</term