applications; the app for Hololens that lets people connect, share, and collaborate in mixed reality that runs on that service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000152">Mesh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000476">Mesh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52798_3000152_3000479"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service, powered by Azure, that enables presence and shared experiences from anywhere – on any device – through mixed reality applications; the app for Hololens that lets people connect, share, and collaborate in mixed reality that runs on that service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000152">Mesh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3000479">Microsoft Mesh</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="528_67425_497698"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The location where the user is currently directing input.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="67425">input focus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497698">foco de entrada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNot