ms experience on a third-party device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007453">hot desking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3008516">espazo de traballo temporal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52948_3007454_3093544"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that listens to students read out loud and gives personalized, AI-infused coaching feedback on how to read better.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007454">Reading Coach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3093544">Adestrador de lectura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52949_3007455_3122511"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The paid Teams standalone MSA-based SKU that will be available for both small businesses and consumers to purchase.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3007455">Microsoft Teams Essentials</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3122511">Teams Essentials</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSel