ier with streamlined recurring revenue management tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3024532">subscription billing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3025221">facturación por subscrición</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53154_3024608_3024897"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item of original video programming, such as the video content created by Microsoft technical experts for docs.microsoft.com.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3024608">show</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3024897">presentación</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53156_3025516_3026455"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The augmented reality development kit, including both the hardware device and software platform, released to third-party developers under NDA.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3025516">ARDK</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3026455">ARDK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">M