 family, including screen time limitations, content restrictions, and friend requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3044723">Xbox Family Settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3044747">Xbox Family Settings</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53438_3045020_3045104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app within Teams that allows users to capture images and videos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045020">Camera</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045104">Cámara</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53441_3045240_3046513"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The root folder in Windows Explorer that shows recently used items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045240">Home</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046513">Inicio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53442_3045241_3046514"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of Windows Enterprise E3 that automatically keeps Windows and Office software up to date on enrolled endpoints.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045241">Windows Autopatch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046514">Windows Autopatch</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53444_3045433_3046296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The RPA mode where the automation is executed when users are in front of their computers. This is suitable when they want to automate tasks and processes at an individual level. The automation is often triggered manually whenever the user wants to run it. The process might require human interaction or decisions between steps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045433">attended</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046296">con supervisión</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53445_3045434_3046297"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sequence of actions in a flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045434">block of actions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046297">bloque de accións</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53446_3045435_3046298"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process of enabling users to interact with web applications and components through UI elements. UI elements describe uniquely the web components that the action is going to handle.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045435">browser automation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046298">automatización do explorador</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53447_3045436_3046299"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The AI Builder component that allows users to detect business cards and extract their information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045436">Business card reader</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046299">Lector de cartóns de visita</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53448_3045437_3046300"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A flow that is being called by the parent flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045437">child flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046300">fluxo secundario</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53449_3045438_3046301"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A qualified lead that can become an account, a contact or an opportunity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045438">converted lead</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046301">cliente potencial convertido</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53450_3045439_3046302"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that improves models by raising confidence scores in AI Builder. Documents can be flagged by users and sent back to the training wizard queue for retraining if they didn't yield sufficient confidence scores when analyzed by AI Builder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045439">feedback loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046302">ciclo de retroalimentación</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53451_3045440_3046303"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prebuilt AI model in AI Builder that extracts key invoice data to help automate the processing of invoices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045440">Invoice processing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046303">Procesamento de facturas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53452_3045441_3046304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Desktop flow execution where automation is happening locally through the console on the user's machine, in an attended mode.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045441">local attended</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046304">con supervisión local</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53453_3045442_3046305"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group that allows you to organize multiple machines together to help distribute your automation workload and optimize productivity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045442">machine group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046305">grupo de máquinas</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53454_3045443_3046306"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Automate app that allows you to connect your machine to the Power Automate cloud. It allows you to harness the full power of your robotic process automation (RPA).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045443">machine-runtime app</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046306">aplicación de tempo de execución da máquina</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53455_3045444_3046307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The custom AI model in AI Builder that can help expedite or automate business processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045444">Object detection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046307">Detección de obxectos</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53456_3045445_3046308"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A flow that calls another flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045445">parent flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046308">fluxo principal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53457_3045446_3046309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Automate licensing plan that allows you to implement critical business processes with enough capacity to serve teams, departments, or the entire organization for an unlimited number of users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045446">per-flow plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046309">plan por fluxo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53458_3045447_3046310"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Automate licensing plan that enables individuals to create unlimited workflows and business processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045447">per-user plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046310">plan por usuario</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53459_3045448_3046311"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The agent that enables direct communication between a virtual desktop through Windows Remote Desktop or Citrix and the Power Automate for desktop app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045448">Power Automate agent for virtual desktops</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046311">Axente de Power Automate para escritorios virtuais</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53460_3045449_3046312"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The browser extension add-on for enabling web automations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045449">Power Automate extension</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046312">Extensión de Power Automate</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53461_3045450_3046313"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that securely saves your secure strings (e.g. passwords) and reuses them to automate applications with UI flows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045450">Sensitive text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046313">Texto confidencial</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53462_3045451_3046314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prebuilt AI model in AI Builder that translates your text data in real time across more than 60 languages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045451">Text translation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046314">Tradución de texto</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53463_3045452_3046315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A comment with a Reply box. When people reply, users can see several comments connected together, showing a virtual conversation in the workbook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045452">threaded comment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046315">fío de comentarios</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53464_3045453_3046316"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The RPA mode where a designated computer or a server is set up to run the automation on behalf of a user. The whole automation process is run fully by Power Automate, and no interaction or decision is made by a human.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3045453">unattended</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046316">sen supervisión</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5348_232402_2766501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The banner near the top of an open email message, appointment, contact, or task that indicates if a message has been replied to or forwarded and that provides the online status of a contact who is using instant messaging.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232402">InfoBar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766501">barra de información</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5348_2765047_2766501"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The banner near the top of an open email message, appointment, contact, or task that indicates if a message has been replied to or forwarded and that provides the online status of a contact who is using instant messaging.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2765047">infobar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2766501">barra de información</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53499_3046570_3047221"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app within the Teams client that contains functionality from both the Microsoft 365 and Teams admin centers and allows admin-type roles to manage app settings directly from the Teams app to improve end-user experience across Microsoft Teams and the Microsoft 365 suite.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046570">Admin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047221">Administración</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53500_3046571_3047222"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A business initiative to be accomplished, a large body of work that spans across releases.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046571">epic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047222">épica</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53501_3046572_3047230"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A platform-related expectation of users for a particular product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046572">platform requirement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047230">requisito da plataforma</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53502_3046573_3047231"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An unplanned event affecting customers and causing a reduction in service quality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046573">service incident</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047231">incidente de servizo</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53503_3046574_3047223"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The product offering for threat intelligence derived from RiskIQ technologies that provides knowledge, insight, and context on threats and adversary-threat infrastructure to help customers improve decision making and security strategies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046574">Microsoft Defender Threat Intelligence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047223">Intelixencia sobre ameazas de Microsoft Defender</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53504_3046575_3047225"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Identity family brand name within the Microsoft Security portfolio.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046575">Microsoft Entra</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047225">Microsoft Entra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53505_3046576_3047226"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The first-party cloud infrastructure entitlements management solution that provides granular visibility, automated remediation and continuous monitoring of identities in hybrid and multi-cloud environments.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046576">Microsoft Entra Permissions Management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml