cept verifiable credentials, which users can store and manage in a digital wallet on their device and use for attestation of personal information and credentials with any organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046577">Microsoft Entra Verified ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3185470">ID verificado</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53506_3180607_3047227"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cloud service that allows companies to issue and accept verifiable credentials, which users can store and manage in a digital wallet on their device and use for attestation of personal information and credentials with any organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3180607">Verified ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047227">ID verificado de Microsoft Entra</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53506_3180607_3185470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cloud service that allows companies to issue and accept verifiable credentials, which users can store and manage in a digital wallet on their device and use for attestation of personal information and credentials with any organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3180607">Verified ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3185470">ID verificado</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53507_3046578_3047228"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Part of the Microsoft Viva family of employee experience offerings, it empowers people to ask for and give anonymous feedback in under two minutes, allowing them to understand how they’re doing and to make necessary changes real time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046578">Microsoft Viva Pulse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047228">Microsoft Viva Pulse</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53508_3046579_3049885"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The program that helps telecom operators participate in Operator Connect (e.g., for fixed lines, mobile, conferencing), using tech and automation to simplify and accelerate the onboarding process and post-onboarding operations through a set of 3rd party providers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3046579">Operator Connect Accelerator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049885">Acelerador da conexión cun operador</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53509_3047005_3048175"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The period of time that a user has had an Xbox Live account, displayed on the user's Xbox console.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047005">tenure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3048175">lonxevidade</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53510_3047006_3048173"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make changes to a video game or piece of computer equipment. [Short for "modify"]</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047006">mod</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3048173">utilizar mods</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53511_3047007_3048167"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In-game content that is created by players (as opposed to a game's developers).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047007">mod</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3048167">mod</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53512_3047008_3048174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A sign-in option in the Microsoft Game Development Kit in which the operating system will ensure that prior to launch of a game that requires a default user, there is a user who is signed in.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047008">simplified user model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3048174">modelo de usuario simplificado</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53514_3047426_3047607"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft Workplace Discount Program (MWDP) is the Microsoft program for employers who meet eligibility criteria that enables their employees to receive discounted pricing on Microsoft products through Microsoft digital store (program formerly known as the Microsoft Home Use Program).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047426">Microsoft Workplace Discount Program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047607">Programa de descontos de Microsoft Workplace</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53521_3047804_3059686"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure Percept component that provides a virtual gateway appliance designed for Azure Stack HCI environments to build, train, and run end-to-end vision AI solutions at the edge with Azure Percept.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3047804">Azure Percept on Azure Stack HCI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059686">Azure Percept on Azure Stack HCI</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53547_3048646_3049881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The functionality in Microsoft Purview that provides organizations with visibility into many types of audited activities across many different services in Microsoft 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3048646">Microsoft Purview Audit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049881">Auditoría de Microsoft Purview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53548_3048647_3049882"