ails of the Azure subscription and a list of environments that are linked to the Azure subscription.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049244">billing policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049819">política de facturación</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53554_3049245_3049820"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prebuilt AI model that is configured to classify customer feedback text into predefined categories such as Issues, Compliment, Customer Service, Documentation, Price &amp; Billing, and Staff.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049245">Category classification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049820">Clasificación de categorías</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53555_3049246_3049821"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container of component definitions that provides a centralized and managed repository of components for reusability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049246">component library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049821">biblioteca de compoñentes</t