 provides a consolidated cross tenant view of all the applications an ISV is distributing to customers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049272">ISV Studio</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3050859">ISV Studio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53582_3049273_3050945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Power Apps low-code solution to write, organize, and automate tests for canvas apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049273">Test Studio</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3050945">Test Studio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53584_3049466_3052206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The support plan designed to match the needs of an organization by providing comprehensive support coverage for their entire Microsoft portfolio through a mix of reactive, proactive, and in-depth support solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3049466">Microsoft Unified Enterprise Support</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3052206">Asistencia técnica empresarial unif