ized commanding experience by populating a set of individually personalized commands in a single line toolbar (V1) and suggesting relevant commands based on the perceived user intent (V2).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080856">personal toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3082268">barra de ferramentas persoal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54037_3080858_3082254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 application that helps users in Teams, Outlook, and Harmony stay in sync with each other on work progress and blockers at any time and in anyplace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080858">Microsoft Check In</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3082254">Check In</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54037_3080858_3082262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 application that helps users in Teams, Outlook, and Harmony stay in sync with each other on work progress and blockers at any time and in anyplace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3080858">Microsoft Check In</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp><