ote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096306">vulnerabilidade crítica da nube</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54287_3095421_3096308"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A loss or potential loss of confidentiality via the unauthorized or accidental disclosure or transfer of sensitive or classified information to an unclassified information system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3095421">information spillage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096308">fuga de información</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54288_3095422_3096309"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action performed to inspect, neutralize, contain, or eradicate a threat entity or a compromised entity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3095422">response action</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096309">acción de resposta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54289_3095423_3096307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service wherein a provider delivers tailored instructions that aid in the performance of response actions; also used to refer to the set of provided instructions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3095423">guided response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096307">resposta guiada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54298_3096485_3097118"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The practice of investigating and remediating active attack campaigns on your organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096485">incident response</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097118">resposta a incidentes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54299_3096486_3097115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The aggregation of information or multiple individual reports pushed out to users during a specific time frame or when certain criteria is met.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3096486">digest</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3097115">