eting view that users can switch into in order to use a Mesh space for the meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118515">immersive space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3123130">espazo envolvente</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55026_3118923_3118948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The different services and products that are accessible to users within Microsoft Fabric.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118923">analytics artifacts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118948">artefactos de análise</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55027_3119009_3119034"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of comprehensive systems, tools, and services that organizations use for their unique analytics efforts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119009">analytics estate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119034">infraestrutura de análise</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelec