 service that gives admins the controls to use Copilot in Edge to manage profile switching for Enterprise AI users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3156313">automatic profile switching</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3158284">cambio de perfil automático</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56113_3156314_3158289"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An opt-in feature in Edge that allows users to receive browser updates as soon as they become available and the computer is idle.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3156314">instant update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3158289">actualización instantánea</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56114_3156315_3158296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A destination on the Edge update page and the Copilot onboarding page with chat prompt suggestions to hep users get started using Copilot in Edge and other Copilot experiences.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3156315">prompt hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3158296">centro de indicacións</t