ed text to the language of their choosing within the side pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3156318">PDF translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3158293">tradutor de PDF</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5613_2654592_497613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A combination of operators, constants, literal values, functions, and names of fields (columns), controls, and properties that evaluates to a single value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2654592">language expression</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497613">expresión</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5613_52530_497613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A combination of operators, constants, literal values, functions, and names of fields (columns), controls, and properties that evaluates to a single value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="52530">expression</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="gl"><ntig><termGrp><term id="497613">expresión</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote typ